					"content": "如果是游客的话，那你可来错地方了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611303,
					"content": "你在做什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611304
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721611304,
					"content": "怎么，你是幕府的人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611305,
					"content": "不是。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721611306,
					"content": "那就管好自己的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611307,
					"content": "这个家伙，怎么这么讨人厌！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611308,
					"content": "我是幕府派来的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611309
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721611309,
					"content": "嗯，你们这些外国人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611310,
					"content": "在奉行大人面前摇尾乞怜，讨得点残渣剩饭，又在稻妻武士面前趾高气扬…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611311,
					"content": "打探来打探去、到处搅混水不说…现在还专程跑来这条破船上，也不知有何贵干。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611312,
					"content": "可惜呀，我不过一介伤兵，没什么能招待你的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611313,
					"content": "所以还要烦请大人自己用腿走出去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611314,
					"content": "这家伙完全不会好好说话吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611315,
					"content": "好了，你们太吵了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611316,
					"content": "临走前给你们一句忠告吧：别在八酝岛待太久，这座岛已经被诅咒了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611317,
					"content": "诅咒…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611318
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721611318,
					"content": "听不懂吗？这座岛被诅咒了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611319,
					"content": "停滞的战争、大人们的欲望、小人物的绝望、无辜受难者的憎恨，老人临终时弥漫满屋的药剂气味…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611320,
					"content": "总而言之，就是诅咒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611321,
					"content": "趁你还没被压垮，赶紧离开吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721611322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻叶久藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721611322,
					"content": "唔…完全听不懂，真是个怪人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7216114,
			"completionStepIds": [],
